  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Allowing us to put buttons on our avatars much like the buttons on our worlds (it will allow us to program toggle things or other effects) - and being able to set the buttons as private or public. This feature will also work well with the future chairs on avatars. A public button on an avatar with a chair will give the illusion of the rider having an interactive element on you. While a private button will allow toggle effects such as removing a helmet or activating an effect while keeping the gestures free.",
